Inspired by Tyler Morgan-Wall's rayshader and rayrender (both GPL-3). sonicray is independent, is not affiliated with him,
and contains no rayrender/rayshader source code.

Third-party components (none is bundled in this repository):
  Rcpp                          GPL (>= 2)   linked into the R package (compatible with GPL-3)
  R                             GPL          runtime
  Intel Open Image Denoise      Apache-2.0   optional, installed separately (brew install open-image-denoise); compatible with GPL-3
  numpy, Pillow                 BSD / HPND   Python runtime dependencies of the GPU compositor, installed separately
  ffmpeg                        LGPL/GPL     external program used for video encoding, installed separately
  Apple Metal, Foundation       system frameworks
  rayrender                     GPL-3        optional; only used by the parity scripts in tools/ and film/ for comparison, installed separately
